      "q": "How much does Iron Bow Technologies make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Iron Bow Technologies has obligated $297M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Iron Bow Technologies won 397 awards this fiscal year, the average award size is $749K, and obligations are down 37.1% year over year. Historical obligations include $706M in FY24 and $472M in FY25."
